 Quartet as they backed up the Legendary James Blackwood at the Great Western Quartet Convention at the Selland Arena in Fresno, CA. Stephen is also a studio drummer and currently records and performs with The Lighthouse Boys, Red Letter Edition and more recently Southern Gospel band Blue Diamonds from Long Beach, CA", "score": 12.6493}], "remaining_searches": 1}
